# Browser

Do not open, navigate, lock, or screenshot localhost (or any app URL) in the Cursor IDE browser.

Only use the IDE browser when the user explicitly says to open it (for example: "open", "open in browser", "check in the browser").

Verify UI another way until then: code review, lints, tests, or curl against the running server.
